      "content": "While Prestige Estates aims for the highest standard, my access is limited to publicly available listing information, not private, proprietary maintenance logs. I cannot access specific, internal digital inspection reports to provide a definitive \"yes\" or \"no\" on structural integrity. For a $20M transaction, professional due diligence is standard, and bringing on a qualified third-party inspector remains the most secure way to ensure your peace of mind.",
